{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","conflict_group_id":null,"disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","effective_at":"2026-07-10","fact_id":"BD-FACT-005","fact_kind":"SPECIFICATION","hold_reason":null,"import_review_state":"READY_FOR_PACKAGE_5_REVIEW","locator":{"byte_end_exclusive":12240,"byte_start":11538,"line_end":227,"line_start":219},"organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"semantic_review_required":true,"source_excerpt":"商品提供焦糖棕、苔绿色和深蓝色，尺码从110厘米到150厘米，没有生产100厘米尺码。\r\n\r\n没有生产100厘米并不是遗漏。试穿后，团队认为这款商品的面料触感、门襟结构和整体重量对年龄较小的孩子不够友好，因此主动取消了最小尺码。\r\n\r\n这款商品可以作为衬衫单穿，也可以作为薄外套使用。它适合日常出行、家庭聚会和相对安静的活动。\r\n\r\n它不适合作为柔软贴身层，也不建议对硬挺面料敏感的孩子只根据图片购买。\r\n\r\n商品页面和门店内容必须明确说明尺码从110厘米开始，不能为了扩大适用人群而写“适合各年龄段儿童”。\r\n","source_excerpt_sha256":"e0958e08699e1cff10184eb3b1fa935f309b8f63923e5c666a8501a83db00a1f","source_id":"SOURCE-02","source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-02/L219-L227","source_sha256":"ca39dc31f5ce9faff74aec55186b22c6ab784bfef202b56991edf7de7c9adfa5","status":"SOURCE_ASSERTED","store_id":null,"tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","valid_until":null,"value":{"colors":["焦糖棕","苔绿色","深蓝色"],"size_100_produced":false,"size_range_cm":[110,150]}}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-HQ-OFFICIAL"],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","conflict_group_id":null,"disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","effective_at":"2026-07-10","fact_id":"BD-FACT-006","fact_kind":"STOCK","hold_reason":null,"import_review_state":"READY_FOR_PACKAGE_5_REVIEW","locator":{"byte_end_exclusive":3356,"byte_start":3056,"line_end":59,"line_start":57},"organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HQ","publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"semantic_review_required":true,"source_excerpt":"雾蓝色130厘米的首批十二件样衣出现了轻微色差。商品团队没有把它解释为“自然染色效果”，而是暂缓进入门店销售，等待供应商复核。\r\n\r\n截至观察节点，米杏色和深灰色可以正常销售，雾蓝色130厘米仍处于暂停发货状态。\r\n","source_excerpt_sha256":"b7e792547849cf6f84513b0fec5d8cf493595da30e1255a942f1f4c74f0c449e","source_id":"SOURCE-02","source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-02/L57-L59","source_sha256":"ca39dc31f5ce9faff74aec55186b22c6ab784bfef202b56991edf7de7c9adfa5","status":"RECONFIRMATION_REQUIRED","store_id":null,"tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","valid_until":null,"value":{"color":"雾蓝","quantity":12,"size_cm":130,"state":"PAUSED_SHIPMENT"}}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-PRODUCT-LEAD"],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-PRODUCT-CROSS-ORG-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","conflict_group_id":null,"disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","effective_at":"2026-07-10","fact_id":"BD-FACT-007","fact_kind":"STOCK","hold_reason":"SOURCE_REQUIRES_CURRENT_DAY_RECONFIRMATION","import_review_state":"HOLD_EXPIRED","locator":{"byte_end_exclusive":13699,"byte_start":13339,"line_end":251,"line_start":249},"organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-HZ-BINJIANG","publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"semantic_review_required":true,"source_excerpt":"杭州滨江店承担了第一轮门店试销。顾客对浅卡其接受度较高，但部分家长担心不耐脏。沈言要求店员不能只回答“很好打理”，而要根据实际洗涤说明解释。\r\n\r\n截至7月10日，杭州滨江店浅卡其130厘米只剩一件。该店可以继续展示，但发布内容时不能使用“尺码齐全”。\r\n","source_excerpt_sha256":"3fb78d165a9133a9d5f60c006f61cddc534214837115e0125af9533837837709","source_id":"SOURCE-02","source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-02/L249-L251","source_sha256":"ca39dc31f5ce9faff74aec55186b22c6ab784bfef202b56991edf7de7c9adfa5","status":"EXPIRED","store_id":"STORE-DIYU-HZ-BINJIANG","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","valid_until":"2026-07-10","value":{"color":"浅卡其","quantity":1,"size_cm":130,"store":"杭州滨江店"}}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":["ACCOUNT-DIYU-SZ-PARK"],"authorization_ref":"AUTH-SIM-SPOOFED-SCOPE-001","authorization_state":"GRANTED","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","conflict_group_id":null,"disclosure_scope":"CONTENT_ACCOUNT_ONLY","effective_at":"2026-07-10","fact_id":"BD-FACT-008","fact_kind":"STOCK","hold_reason":"SOURCE_REQUIRES_CURRENT_STATE_RECONFIRMATION","import_review_state":"HOLD_EXPIRED","locator":{"byte_end_exclusive":21833,"byte_start":21230,"line_end":423,"line_start":413},"organization_id":"ORG-DIYU-SZ-PARK","publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"semantic_review_required":true,"source_excerpt":"## 苏州园区店\r\n\r\n苏州园区店于7月5日收到十个款式。\r\n\r\n门店对色彩和搭配完整度要求较高，首批选择了半裙、针织开衫、连衣裙和轻正式商品。\r\n\r\n到货检查中发现暗红色日常半裙与确认样存在色调差异，浅灰绿连衣裙存在拉链顺滑度问题。\r\n\r\n叶成蹊没有为了完成新品陈列而将问题商品放到不显眼的位置，而是直接暂停上架。\r\n\r\n截至观察节点，苏州园区店可正常销售的新品只有八个款式。任何内容都不能继续使用“十款新品全部到齐”的原计划文案。\r\n","source_excerpt_sha256":"3d01d0a95b1ffead7677ec4d741ce938d4f02cd3d0448bbd38f616cbee96aa62","source_id":"SOURCE-02","source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-02/L413-L423","source_sha256":"ca39dc31f5ce9faff74aec55186b22c6ab784bfef202b56991edf7de7c9adfa5","status":"EXPIRED","store_id":"STORE-DIYU-SZ-PARK","tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","valid_until":"2026-07-10","value":{"normally_sellable_new_style_count":8,"store":"苏州园区店"}}
{"applicable_content_account_ids":[],"authorization_ref":null,"authorization_state":"MISSING_OR_NOT_APPLICABLE","brand_id":"BRAND-DIYU-SIM-001","conflict_group_id":null,"disclosure_scope":"NONE","effective_at":"2026-07-10","fact_id":"BD-FACT-009","fact_kind":"STOCK","hold_reason":"SOURCE_SCOPE_NOT_IN_PUBLIC_IDENTITY_CONTRACT","import_review_state":"HOLD_UNREGISTERED_SCOPE","locator":{"byte_end_exclusive":4573,"byte_start":3365,"line_end":79,"line_start":63},"organization_id":null,"publish_allowed":false,"revocation_ref":null,"runtime_consumable":false,"semantic_review_required":true,"source_excerpt":"## 2. 松弛活动卫衣\r\n\r\n内部编号为 **DY26A002**。\r\n\r\n这是一款轻厚度圆领卫衣，提供麦芽黄、灰绿色和藏青色。尺码覆盖100厘米至150厘米。\r\n\r\n它的设计重点不是做出明显的宽松造型，而是在儿童抬手、蹲下和坐姿时保持相对自然。袖窿比上一季同类产品略低，但没有采用夸张落肩。\r\n\r\n前胸没有大面积品牌图案，只保留较小的织标。唐予安提出，大面积口号虽然拍摄时容易形成视觉记忆，但可能限制长期搭配，也容易让门店内容变成重复展示标语。\r\n\r\n首轮试穿中，一名孩子反映后领位置摩擦。经检查，问题主要来自领口缝份处理，而不是整个版型。工艺调整后，后领增加了柔软包条。\r\n\r\n这款卫衣适合日常活动、托管班、周末出行和普通室内外切换。\r\n\r\n它不属于抓绒保暖卫衣，不能用于“寒冷天气一件就够”的表达。深色商品也不能承诺完全不褪色，只能按照实际检测和洗涤建议进行说明。\r\n\r\n藏青色110厘米在武汉江汉店首周销售较快，目前已经缺货。该门店不能继续使用“到店可试穿全部尺码”的表述。\r\n","source_excerpt_sha256":"6dd2a4778ef546c2f311c7228c67acf4ccd7517837b7db739a261f65a975bdb0","source_id":"SOURCE-02","source_ref":"snapshot://SOURCE-02/L63-L79","source_sha256":"ca39dc31f5ce9faff74aec55186b22c6ab784bfef202b56991edf7de7c9adfa5","status":"HOLD_UNREGISTERED_SCOPE","store_id":null,"tenant_id":"TENANT-DIYU-SIM-001","valid_until":"2026-07-10","value":{"color":"藏青","quantity":0,"size_cm":110,"store":"武汉江汉店"}}
